            {
              "method": "POST",
              "path": "/v1/content/{id}/deletion-requests",
              "title": "Request content deletion.",
              "description": "Request content deletion.",
              "auth": "Required (creator/admin)",
              "idempotent": "Yes",
              "rateLimit": "10/min",
              "requestBody": "{\n  \"reason\": \"I want to remove this content\"\n}",
              "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"delete_pending\",\n  \"deletionRequestedAt\": \"2026-08-15T08:00:00Z\",\n  \"purgeScheduledAt\": \"2026-09-14T08:00:00Z\",\n  \"canRestoreUntil\": \"2026-09-14T08:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "queryParams": [],
              "bodyParams": [
                {
                  "Field": "`reason`",
                  "Type": "string",
                  "Required": "Yes",
                  "Description": "Reason for deletion"
                }
              ],
              "errorCodes": [
                {
                  "Code": "`CONFLICT`",
                  "HTTP": "409",
                  "Description": "Content has active obligations"
                }
              ],
              "markdown": "Request content deletion.\n\n**Auth:** Required (creator/admin)\n\n**Idempotent:** Yes\n\n**Rate Limit:** 10/min\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | string (UUID) | Content ID |\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"reason\": \"I want to remove this content\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `reason` | string | Yes | Reason for deletion |\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"delete_pending\",\n  \"deletionRequestedAt\": \"2026-08-15T08:00:00Z\",\n  \"purgeScheduledAt\": \"2026-09-14T08:00:00Z\",\n  \"canRestoreUntil\": \"2026-09-14T08:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Error Codes:**\n| Code | HTTP | Description |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| `CONFLICT` | 409 | Content has active obligations |\n\n---"
            },
            {
